	(text "Resolver excitation buffer, ported verbatim from PALTA resolver.sch:\nAD8397 dual high-current op-amp, inverting gain -1.54 (10k / 15.4k || 120 pF),\ninputs biased at 3.75 V (22k/10k from +12 V), single +12 V supply.\n+12 V comes from the central aux rail (D020) - legacy on-sheet 78M12\nfrom +24 V not ported."
