	(text "ABI encoder input - conditioning replicates the PALTA hall\npattern (10k series + BAT54S clamp, pull-up sites DNP).\nENC_A/B/I are SHARED with the AD2S1205 emulation outputs:\nresolver emulation OR external encoder, not both - select by\nR816-R818 (fit for resolver) vs encoder plugged into ENC_*_IN.\nA/B/NM are 5 V CMOS: route ENC_A/B/I and RES_SPI_* only to\n5 V-tolerant (FT) MCU pins (PALTA precedent: 5 V SO/DOS/LOT\ninto F405 FT pins)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 325.12 122.0 0)
		(effects
